BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 777.89 Tm (1. Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 743.89 Tm (TTCS, short for Task and Teleconference System, is a web-based platform designed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 727.94 Tm (combine task coordination, meeting management, attendance tracking, and internal) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 711.99 Tm (communication in one system. Instead of switching between separate applications for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 696.04 Tm (assignments, meetings, and updates, TTCS allows users and administrators to work) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 680.09 Tm (inside one shared environment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 652.14 Tm (The current TTCS build includes separate user and admin workspaces. Each workspace) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 636.19 Tm (has a sidebar-based navigation layout and gives access to tools that match the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 620.24 Tm (account role.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 584.29 Tm (1.1 What is TTCS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 556.29 Tm (TTCS is a centralized system for:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 528.34 Tm (-) Tj ET
