BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 777.89 Tm (Yes. The admin task form supports multiple assignees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 749.94 Tm (`How is attendance recorded?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 721.99 Tm (Attendance is recorded automatically when the meeting room is opened and exited) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 706.04 Tm (through TTCS.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 678.09 Tm (`Can deleted inbox conversations still be recovered?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 650.14 Tm (Yes. A deleted conversation can be restored from trash before the 31-day deletion) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 634.19 Tm (period ends.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 606.24 Tm (`Does TTCS currently have a visible forgot-password page?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 578.29 Tm (No. The current visible interface does not expose a dedicated forgot-password page.) Tj ET
